    "sections": {
        "description": "Kahel takes its name from the Filipino word for orange, an inspiration reflected in its warm citrus palette, energetic personality, and distinctive editorial style. Built as a native WordPress block theme, it gives publishers, writers, creatives, and organizations a polished foundation for blogs, journals, magazines, and story-driven websites. Kahel works with the Site Editor and core WordPress blocks without requiring a page builder or custom-block plugin. Its coordinated templates, patterns, block styles, expressive layouts, and customizable global styles make it approachable for new users while offering the flexibility experienced creators need."
    },
